{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PNzvJnDMsC1792751526.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產九龍站副區域營業董事余倫鋒表示，分行最新促成1宗九龍站凱旋門租賃成交，單位為1座中層D室，實用面積846平方呎，採三房套房間隔，另設工人套房，單位座向北方，望清靜內園景，最新以55000元租出，折合實用呎租65元。<br/>據悉，上址業主2008年5月以約1760萬元購入單位，持貨18年，近年一直作收租用途，是次租出單位可享3.8厘租金回報，回報理想。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:40.089666+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:58:11.766367+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:25.223372+00:00","content_hash":"2b502dbd773d0590a31135c028b1cf14bf42224ae5fa63133afc38eec48b518d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:40.089666+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}